OL,5,G2300 Academy Of Ancient Music:
OL,6,G     Vivaldi's Four Seasons
OL,7,     FEnjoy the sounds of wintery
OL,8,     Fblizzards and summer days in
OL,9,     FVivaldi's popular work, performed
OL,10,     Fhere by the Academy of Ancient
OL,11,     FMusic and violinist Rachel Podger.
OL,12,G0030 Notre-Dame: The Renaissance
OL,13,     FOver five years following the
OL,14,     Fdevastating fire, France's
OL,15,     Frenowned Notre-Dame de Paris has
OL,16,     Fonce again opened its doors,
OL,17,     Fmarked by a glamorous concert to
OL,18,     Fhonour its restoration.
